# Mental Health Resources

This folder contains the source materials used by the Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system. These resources will be processed into searchable text chunks and vector embeddings to support chatbot responses.

Examples of resources may include:

- World Health Organization (WHO) mental health publications
- Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) educational materials
- Publicly available mental wellness guides
- Research articles and reference documents approved for project use

All resources included in this folder should be publicly available, properly attributed, and used solely for educational and informational purposes.
